# --- Tomcat Embedded (Spring Boot 3.3.6 Managed) ---
# Mitigated: Form / Digest authenticators are not enabled; backend uses stateless JWT authentication via Spring Security
CVE-2026-43512
CVE-2026-43515
CVE-2026-65182
CVE-2026-65905
CVE-2026-68525
# Mitigated: WebDAV partial PUT is disabled; HTTP/2 is terminated at the reverse proxy (Nginx)
CVE-2025-24813
CVE-2026-41293

# --- Netty Handler (Transitive via Spring Data Redis / Lettuce) ---
# Mitigated: Netty client is used solely for internal Redis connection; no inbound TLS traffic is handled by Netty
CVE-2026-75595

# --- Spring Security / Spring WebMVC ---
# Mitigated: XsltView is not in use; stateless REST API with strict CORS and SecurityFilterChain
CVE-2026-22732
CVE-2026-47884

